      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Ben Scales, Southern Cross Solar Renewables, seems to be the local installer of choice that other installers recommend when a job is challenging.  Pricing was as you would expect for a top tier installation; no bargains but not excessive either. The proposal contract is extensive and explains what will be installed quite well.The sub-contractors certainly seem to know what they are doing. A Tesla battery PV install is quite complex, with LOTS of wiring, especially when using microinverters with assocaited controllers. They keep cabling neat and as unobtrusive as possible in a very challenging builduing construction they were dealing with.Still awaiting final stages of approval from supply authority, but system has been commissioned and working as expected.",
